@startuml TEntity
title TEntity — State Machine
' Internal context: legIdx (int), atSrc (boolean)

hide empty description

[*] --> Plan

Plan --> Plan     : [backlog empty]\n/ schedule(now + PLAN_INTERVAL)

Plan --> Transfer : [backlog non-empty]\n/ itinerary = buildItineraryFromBacklog()\n/ legIdx = 0, atSrc = true\n/ schedule(leg[0].src.transferSrtTime)

Transfer --> Move : [atSrc, at src.transferEndTime]\n/ SerialRecord(finish, load) × N\n/ SEntities.state = Move\n/ schedule each SE\n/ schedule(TE, dst.transferSrtTime)

Move --> Transfer : [at dst.transferSrtTime]\n/ TransportRecord(start, unload)\n/ SerialRecord(start, unload) × N\n/ atSrc = false\n/ schedule(dst.transferEndTime)

Transfer --> Transfer : [!atSrc, more legs remain]\n/ legIdx++, atSrc = true\n/ schedule(next src.transferSrtTime)

Transfer --> Plan : [!atSrc, no legs remain]\n/ schedule(now + PLAN_INTERVAL)

note right of Transfer
  atSrc=true, at transferSrtTime:
    recordEvent(TransportRecord(start, load, [serials], srcNode))
    recordEvent(SerialRecord(start, load, serial, transport, srcNode)) × N
    schedule(src.transferEndTime)

  atSrc=true, at transferEndTime:
    recordEvent(SerialRecord(finish, load, serial, transport, srcNode)) × N
    SEntities.state = Move  [see transition label]

  atSrc=false, at transferSrtTime:
    [handled on transition from Move — see label]

  atSrc=false, at transferEndTime:
    recordEvent(TransportRecord(finish, unload, [serials], dstNode))
    recordEvent(SerialRecord(finish, unload, serial, transport, dstNode)) × N
    SEntities.state = Delivered or Select
end note

note right of Move
  Traveling to dst.
  No records emitted here.
  TransportRecord(start, unload)
  and SerialRecord(start, unload)
  are emitted on the transition
  INTO Transfer (atSrc=false).
end note

@enduml
